          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On February 1, 1985, around 6:00 PM, several witnesses will spot a peculiar glow for 3 seconds. Passing very quickly overhead, they observe a green ball followed by a conical flow ranging from pale yellow to brilliant red. This beautifully phenomenon remains silent. Although various elements suggest an atmospheric reentry, no further information could be gathered about this event.",
